; Save the middle of the screen and the attributes
;
; Called by #R$A336 before the controls screen is drawn. Sets A = 0 (NOPs) and jumps into the copier at #R$A45E: the
; bitmap of the middle screen third ($4800-$4FFF) goes to $C500 and the whole attribute file ($5800-$5AFF) to $5B00.
; Both are scratch areas of the game (the redraw buffer at $C500 and the tile map at $5B00) that are not in use while
; the title and the menus are shown.
; .
; Hardware: reads the screen bitmap and attributes.
@label=SaveMenuArea
c$A44D XOR A         ;
 $A44E JR $A45E      ; copy screen to buffers (the copier gets NOPs)
